                  "type": "application",
                  "title": "Install The Statue This Week",
                  "content": "**The seven-day Statue protocol:**\n\n1. **Today — Adopt the gap as a vow**: For the next 7 days, every charged conversation gets at least 4 silent seconds before you respond. No exceptions. No \"but it was urgent.\" The vow is the practice.\n\n2. **Tonight — Run your first Cold Audit**: Notebook, 10 minutes, list every emotional hijack from today. Three columns: leak, cost, patch.\n\n3. **Tomorrow — Pick your sparring partner**: Identify the ONE person whose moods most consistently move you. They are now your training partner — every interaction with them is a rep.\n\n4. **Wednesday — Try the Outside View live**: In one real conversation, silently narrate yourself in third person while it's happening. Notice the distance.\n\n5. **Sunday — Audit the audits**: Review the week's notebook entries. Circle the patterns. Name the three leaks you will armor against next week.",
