                  "explanation": "The Statue is defined by the **gap between trigger and response**, not by speed, warmth, retaliation, or avoidance. Replying instantly — even warmly — skips the gap. Blocking them is suppression, the cold-person trap Taylor explicitly warns against. Matching their tone is the Reactive Loop. The sovereign move is to **insert deliberate space** (here, a night), let the amygdala spike resolve, see the menu of possible responses, and then choose with intent. Sometimes the chosen response is warm. Sometimes it's firm. The key is that it was **chosen**, not triggered.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">FINAL CHECK</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"120\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE TEST</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">11 PM text from a friend, sharp-edged.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">What does the Statue actually do?</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"340\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SOVEREIGN MOVE</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Silence the phone.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"478\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Sleep on it.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"511\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Choose tomorrow.</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"580\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">REACTIVE TRAPS</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Instant warm reply (no gap)</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"718\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Block them (suppression)</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"751\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Match their tone (reactor)</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"820\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE PRINCIPLE</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Sovereignty lives in the gap.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Chosen response &gt; fast response.</text>\n                                        </svg>",
                    "caption": "The whole lesson in one decision"
                  }
