                  "explanation": "Trying to install 11 skills at once installs zero. Re-reading the book is a stalling tactic disguised as preparation. \"When life calms down\" is the lie that keeps women dysregulated forever — life will not calm down; **you** calm down. The whole point of this book is that regulation is built through **specific, small, repeated practice in real conditions**. Pick one. 30 days. Now. That's how a nervous system actually changes.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">FINAL KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"120\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE CLOSING ASSIGNMENT</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">One practice. Thirty days.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Starting with the next exhale.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">That's the whole thing.</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"370\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">TRAP: ALL 11 AT ONCE</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">trying to install everything = installing nothing</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"510\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">TRAP: WAIT FOR CALM</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">life will not calm down — you do</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"650\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">THE MOVE: ONE. 30. NOW.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">small + specific + repeated = nervous system change</text>\n                                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"820\" width=\"700\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE REGULATED WOMAN</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">does not start on Monday.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">She starts with the next exhale.</text>\n                                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"18\">Take it now.</text>\n                                        </svg>",
                    "caption": "Final check — and your starting line"
                  }
