                  "explanation": "The **frenulum** is the most nerve-dense single structure — roughly 3 to 4 times more concentrated than the surrounding skin of the glans. The glans (the most tempting wrong answer) does have dense nerve endings overall, but they fatigue quickly and are not the densest single patch. The **prostate** and **perineum** are major pleasure centers, but they produce different kinds of sensation rather than the highest nerve density. Knowing the frenulum by name closes one of the most common knowledge gaps in long-term couples.",
