                  "explanation": "Affirmation words (\"yes,\" \"more,\" \"don't stop\") and sensation words (\"slower,\" \"deeper,\" \"right there\") are the lowest-stakes entry points: they sound like feedback or instructions rather than confessions, so they don't trigger the cringe response. Both deliver enormous erotic charge because they prove presence and attention. Starting with body words, want-language, or emotion-during words is fine eventually — but if comfort is the bottleneck, sensation + affirmation is the proven on-ramp. And pairing this with the Flinch Test ensures every word deployed is genuinely yours.",
