                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Reading the muted signal</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE SETUP</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Touch 1 sent. Reply: \"ok\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">What does midday look like?</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"390\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WRONG MOVES</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Escalate harder</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Send a photo</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Skip to declaration</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">All push past calibration</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"390\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">RIGHT MOVE</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Warm. Non-sexual.</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Back off the build.</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Try again tomorrow.</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Respect the signal</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"820\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">The day is not the moment</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Calibration beats persistence every time"
