                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">RECOVERY PROTOCOL</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">When you go blank, do this</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"190\" width=\"1000\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">1.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Exhale audibly — already dirty talk</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"290\" width=\"1000\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">2.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">One word: \"yes.\" Buy yourself a beat.</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"390\" width=\"1000\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">3.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Repeat if needed — \"yes... yes...\"</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"490\" width=\"1000\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">4.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Wait for a moment to narrate</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"590\" width=\"1000\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">5.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Resume with narration or direction</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"710\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE EMERGENCY KIT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">\"Yes.\"  \"More.\"  \"Don't stop.\"  \"That's it.\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"910\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Stay verbal. Eloquence is optional.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Blanks are part of rhythm, not failure"
