                  "explanation": "The recovery protocol is: audible exhale first (which reopens your breath AND functions as dirty talk on its own), then one word of affirmation like \"yes\" or \"more.\" Forcing a full sentence under brain fog will sound stilted. Accepting silence permanently surrenders the skill. Changing positions dodges the actual issue. Breath, then one word — that is the entire fix, and it works every time.",
