                  "title": "Your Post-Sex Protocol",
                  "content": "Tonight, after sex, run this exact sequence. No improvising the first time — just follow the steps.\n\n1. **Stay.** Phone goes face-down across the room before sex starts. Don't move from each other for ten minutes minimum.\n\n2. **Say one specific thanks.** Pick one moment from the encounter. Name it. \"When you ___ — that ___.\" One sentence.\n\n3. **Say one body affirmation.** Pick one part of them or how they moved. \"Your ___ is ___.\" One sentence.\n\n4. **Say one future tense.** \"I want to do that again.\" Or \"Next time can we ___.\" One sentence.\n\n5. **Tomorrow morning, send the callback text.** Before noon. Short. Specific to last night. Eight seconds of typing.\n\nThat is the entire protocol. Five small moves. Practiced for a month, they will reshape how your partner experiences sex with you — and how you experience it back.",
