                  "explanation": "Specificity inside the oxytocin window is the highest-leverage move you have. Naming exactly what they did — body part, timing, what it felt like — gets encoded by their bonding brain as a core truth about what you love. They will repeat it. Waiting until daylight loses the imprinting window. \"That was amazing\" is too generic to be useful. The morning callback is great, but it works BEST as a layer on top of the in-window specific thanks, not as a replacement for it.",
