                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why text before voice?</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"200\" width=\"500\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WEEK 1: TEXT</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No tone</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No eye contact</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No real-time pressure</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">One variable: the words</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"200\" width=\"480\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WEEK 2: VOICE</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Tone matters</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Eyes are watching</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Live, no editing</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Many variables at once</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"580\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE PRINCIPLE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Start with the simplest version of the move.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Master it. THEN add complexity.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"820\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PROGRESSION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Text first. Voice second. Always.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Isolate variables — then layer them"
